# Review a plan

Read the `review-plan` skill. Edit the plan in place. Do not implement.

## House stops

- Quote `plan-ban-sweep` RECEIPT. Isolated `plan-checker` PASS before APPROVED.
- Refresh CreatePlan so **Build** matches the reviewed plan.
- Verdict: APPROVED | APPROVED WITH CONDITIONS | BLOCKED.
- No commit unless asked (`git-safety`).
